# A partial pass must never read as a compliance report.
MODULE: ReportOnlyWhenSucceededCancelPublishes
TARGET: ReportOnlyWhenSucceeded
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a cancelled scan publishes its partial counts as a report
PERTURBS: Cancel

--- FIND
    /\ Running
    /\ phase' = "Cancelled"
    /\ UNCHANGED envVars /\ UNCHANGED reportVars
--- REPLACE
    /\ Running
    /\ phase' = "Cancelled"
    /\ hasReport' = TRUE
    /\ UNCHANGED envVars /\ UNCHANGED <<repHasPolicy, repRuleCount, repReasons>>
--- END
